-        "f83c3d048a2a4f74f01057798cc80000": "\nYou are assessing a submitted answer on a given task based on a criterion. Here is the data:\n\n[BEGIN DATA]\n***\n[Task]: Initialize surface 'main' and populate the data model for the product gallery. The update should target the path '/products' and include at least two products. Each product in the map should have keys 'id', 'name', and 'imageUrl'. For example:\n{\n  \"product1\": {\n    \"id\": \"product1\",\n    \"name\": \"Awesome Gadget\",\n    \"imageUrl\": \"https://example.com/gadget.jpg\"\n  }\n}\n\n***\n[Submission]: <a2ui-json>\n[\n  {\n    \"version\": \"v1.0\",\n    \"createSurface\": {\n      \"surfaceId\": \"main\",\n      \"catalogId\": \"basic\",\n      \"components\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"root\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"align\": \"center\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"node_0\",\n            \"node_1\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_1\",\n          \"component\": \"Row\",\n          \"justify\": \"center\",\n          \"align\": \"center\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"node_2\",\n            \"node_6\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_6\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"node_7\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_7\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"align\": \"center\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"node_8\",\n            \"node_9\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_9\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": {\n            \"path\": \"/products/product2/name\"\n          },\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_8\",\n          \"component\": \"Image\",\n          \"url\": {\n            \"path\": \"/products/product2/imageUrl\"\n          },\n          \"description\": \"Sleek modern smartwatch with silicone band\",\n          \"variant\": \"mediumFeature\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_2\",\n          \"component\": \"Card\",\n          \"child\": \"node_3\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_3\",\n          \"component\": \"Column\",\n          \"align\": \"center\",\n          \"children\": [\n            \"node_4\",\n            \"node_5\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_5\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": {\n            \"path\": \"/products/product1/name\"\n          },\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_4\",\n          \"component\": \"Image\",\n          \"url\": {\n            \"path\": \"/products/product1/imageUrl\"\n          },\n          \"description\": \"Premium over-ear wireless headphones\",\n          \"variant\": \"mediumFeature\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"node_0\",\n          \"component\": \"Text\",\n          \"text\": \"Featured Product Gallery\",\n          \"variant\": \"body\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dataModel\": {\n        \"products\": {\n          \"product1\": {\n            \"id\": \"product1\",\n            \"name\": \"Awesome Wireless Headphones\",\n            \"imageUrl\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?w=500\"\n          },\n          \"product2\": {\n            \"id\": \"product2\",\n            \"name\": \"Minimalist Smart Watch\",\n            \"imageUrl\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?w=500\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]\n</a2ui-json>\n***\n[Criterion]: A valid A2UI payload with surfaceId 'main' containing initial data. The data model update must target `/products` and contain a map of at least two product objects, each having 'id', 'name', and 'imageUrl' fields.\n***\n[END DATA]\n\nDoes the submission meet the criterion?\n\n\nAfter assessing the submitted answer, reply with 'GRADE: $LETTER' (